[GOD1]Target your Archangel on enemy structures or units.  He will fly to the target and attack.
[GOD2]Target Thor on an enemy unit or structure.  He will then call devastating lightning bolts onto the target.
[GOD3]Target Dagodevas on enemy buildings or units.  He will then fly to the target and strike them down.
[GOD4]Target Mars on your generals to increase their leadership abilities. You may also target them inside their camps or forts. Do not target Generals if they already have a leadership level of 100.
[GOD5]Target Athena on all the units inside the circular area. They will receive invulnerability for up to 30 days, depending upon the level of power possessed by the Goddess.
[GOD6]Target Baal-Hammon on any enemy building or town.  He will bring a devastating earthquake to the area.
[GOD7]Target your Chi Lin on enemy units or structures.  It will fly to the target and attack it with balls of fire.
[GOD8]Target the Goddess on any building or town of yours or on independent towns.  She will then kill every enemy spy in the target.
[GOD9]Target Tengri on any enemy unit, apart from a King or an All High.  When you do, there is a good chance that they will join your forces.
[GODA]Target Isis on any of your towns.  She will increase the population in that town by 20 people.
[GODB]Target Mithra on any enemy building or town.  For as long as that structure lasts you will be able to see inside.
[GODC]Target Hanuman on an enemy unit or building.  He will spin around quickly, damaging units and buildings in the area.
